{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1939,
    "dDurationMs": 5110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, my name is Henry Reich, I make stick\nfigure videos about physics, and I’m trying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7049,
    "dDurationMs": 1661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to break up with Curiosity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8710,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, not the robot on Mars… it's already\nin a long distance relationship with someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11860,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12860,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm talking about Curiosity Curiosity – the\none I can't get off my mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17240,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, there are a lot of good things about\nCuriosity: Curiosity taught me language; Curiosity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21700,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shared my excitement about the detection of\ngravitational waves; Curiosity urged me to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26070,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see how tall of a tower I could build before\nit fell over and waited patiently for me to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30380,
    "dDurationMs": 4549,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "try a million different paper airplane designs;\nCuriosity took me to watch the Leonid meteor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34929,
    "dDurationMs": 4691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shower, carried me through school, taught\nme calculus, showed me how jig saws work and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39620,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to unclog the toilet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41210,
    "dDurationMs": 3919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah yeah, but Curiosity has some serious\ndeal-breakers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45129,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For one, Curiosity's got no loyalty – I\nmean, how many of you also have a relationship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50949,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with Curiosity?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51949,
    "dDurationMs": 1061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What a player."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53010,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can't shake Curiosity – no matter\nwhere I go, what I do, what I think about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58350,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Curiosity keeps butting in, going off on tangents\nand asking questions about anything and everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64190,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Curiosity made me read all of Harry Potter\nand the Deathly Hallows in one sitting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68750,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Curiosity tells me things I don’t want\nto hear – like, I'm not going to live forever?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73270,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Toddlers are better at learning Chinese than\nI am?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76230,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Genetic modification isn't always bad; sweet,\ndelicious desserts aren't good for me; flying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80930,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across the world in AWESOME metal sky-birds\nis contributing to the destabilization of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85360,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our planet's entire bio-hydro-geo-atmospheric\nsystem?!."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89360,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after all that stuff I don't want to hear,\nCuriosity has the nerve to tell me I have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93470,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "intrinsic biases against ideas that disagree\nwith my world view even if they're right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98670,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But most problematically, Curiosity has no\nmoral compass, and never has."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103810,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Long ago, Curiosity taught us how to start\nfires for cooking, for warmth, and to destroy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108500,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "neighboring villages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110450,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Curiosity taught us how to manipulate metals\ntaken from the ground and make plows and scythes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114360,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to plant and harvest food, and swords to kill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118200,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Curiosity taught us to use long-dead metamorphosed\nplants and phytoplankton to power the rise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122510,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of global civilization and the rise of global\ntemperatures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127200,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Curiosity taught us how to split and fuse\natomic nuclei to generate electricity, to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131580,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make medicine, and to destroy entire cities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135290,
    "dDurationMs": 5490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Curiosity taught us to build miraculous portable\npersonal-augmentation computer-camera-communicators,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140780,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to use them to spy on each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143550,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Curiosity taught me I can use a magnifying\nglass to focus sunlight and burn insects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148520,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes, Curiosity's a jerk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150510,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But still, I haven't been able to break up\nwith Curiosity – I mean, did you know that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154010,
    "dDurationMs": 5270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you lift a clock just one meter, earth's\ngravity causes it to run fast by a few nanoseconds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159280,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every year? – and I bet you probably have\na hard time with Curiosity, too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163990,
    "dDurationMs": 4750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, if there's one thing Curiosity's\ntaught me, it's that human beings fall hard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168740,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for Curiosity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169760,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, look at this guy – he's totally\nin a manipulative relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174290,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I suspect we're ultimately just going to have\nto figure out how to live with Curiosity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178770,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, here's the biggest lesson I've learned\nthus far: Curiosity pushes us to unlock lots"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184270,
    "dDurationMs": 6410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lots of doors, doors to things lifechanging\nand worldchanging in good and bad ways; if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190680,
    "dDurationMs": 2329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we listen, Curiosity can help us lay all the\nfacts on the table about what each of those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193009,
    "dDurationMs": 1221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doors to the future might bring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194230,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the end of the day, it's up to us to\ndecide which ones we want to go through."
    } ]
  } ]
}
